### ============================================================
### Borrowing requests + item checkout/return lifecycle
### Alur tipikal (admin):
###   1) staff create request → 2) admin approve
###   3) admin checkout tiap item → parent jadi diproses
###   4) admin return tiap item → parent jadi selesai
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@requestId = 5
@borrowingItemId = 1
@staffUserId = 3

### List borrowing requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests?status=diajukan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show borrowing request
GET {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create borrowing request
# @name createBorrowing
POST {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requested_by": {{staffUserId}},
  "purpose": "Pengujian rutin sampel air",
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Update borrowing request (purpose/notes only — status dilarang)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "Pengujian rutin sampel air (revisi)",
  "notes": "Prioritas sedang"
}

### Approve (admin, status harus diajukan)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject (admin, status harus diajukan)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rejection_reason": "Barang tidak tersedia minggu ini"
}

### Cancel (admin atau pemilik request)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests/{{requestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-cancel via destroy (status → batal, 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Borrowing items — checkout / return (admin only)
### Ganti @borrowingItemId dengan id dari items[] di response create/show
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Checkout item (parent harus disetujui)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-items/{{borrowingItemId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expected_return_date": "2026-08-20T17:00:00"
}

### Return item — kondisi baik
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-items/{{borrowingItemId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "condition_after": "baik",
  "is_damaged": false,
  "check_notes": "Kondisi baik, tidak ada kerusakan"
}

### Return item — rusak (otomatis buat item_maintenance bila ada item_unit_id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/borrowing-items/{{borrowingItemId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "condition_after": "rusak_ringan",
  "is_damaged": true,
  "damage_notes": "Housing retak ringan di sisi kanan",
  "check_notes": "Perlu maintenance"
}
